     "bone": "spine"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "name": "OH_React_Lifted",
   "description": "Lifted into the air by magic (the game raises and moves him; he must stay in place): legs dangle and kick, arms flail, struggles. Loops seamlessly while he floats.",
